# Regression test for the .raflash resolver path.
#
# The Makefile builds .tests/StagehandGame.raflash (a zip wrapping
# StagehandGame.swf with a distinctive hashOverride of all-a's) via
# tests/build-raflash.ts as a prerequisite of `make test-stagehand`. This
# test proves that:
#   1. The scanner indexes .raflash files, not just .swf
#   2. data.json.hashOverride is used as the identity (not the inner SWF's MD5)
#   3. Stagehand launches the extracted SWF bytes correctly

hash aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
port 18092

assert stage.fireCount == 0
click stage.fireButton
assert stage.fireCount == 1
tick 2
assert stage.tickCount == 2
